Shang Zhitao.

266
00:18:39,905 --> 00:18:41,945
Let's go to the bar
in the mountains tomorrow.

267
00:18:45,065 --> 00:18:46,145
Okay.

268
00:18:49,385 --> 00:18:50,625
Let's go, silly dog.

269
00:18:51,385 --> 00:18:52,545
Let's go.

270
00:18:59,145 --> 00:19:01,665
-What do you think?
-The renovation is already done?

271
00:19:03,065 --> 00:19:04,305
It looks good.

272
00:19:07,425 --> 00:19:09,585
-Luke.
-Luke, come here.

273
00:19:14,905 --> 00:19:16,705
This is better than I imagined.

274
00:19:16,785 --> 00:19:17,705
Do you like it?

275
00:19:18,905 --> 00:19:20,745
I love your renovation choices.

276
00:19:24,185 --> 00:19:25,425
Let Luke roam freely.

277
00:19:26,025 --> 00:19:28,025
Go, Luke. Don't pee or poop anywhere.

278
00:19:28,105 --> 00:19:29,425
He won't.

279
00:19:36,745 --> 00:19:39,585
Once the glassware is here, you will
have the first drink from the bartender.

280
00:19:40,625 --> 00:19:42,585
When is the bartender coming?

281
00:19:49,065 --> 00:19:51,185
You know how to mix drinks?

282
00:19:52,425 --> 00:19:55,505
When this place opens to the public,
you will be our first client.

283
00:19:56,225 --> 00:19:58,145
And you shall witness my mixing skills.

284
00:19:58,745 --> 00:20:00,865
For the moment,
I can only make you sky juice.

285
00:20:02,185 --> 00:20:04,505
Sky juice? Just call it mineral water.

286
00:20:09,865 --> 00:20:10,945
Luke.

287
00:20:11,025 --> 00:20:12,505
Come and drink.

288
00:20:13,585 --> 00:20:14,465
Luke.

289
00:20:15,945 --> 00:20:16,985
Come. Luke.

290
00:20:36,825 --> 00:20:37,985
Don't drink this one for the opening day.

291
00:20:38,065 --> 00:20:40,345
My friend gave me a bottle
of 25-year-old whiskey.

292
00:20:40,425 --> 00:20:41,265
Allow me to introduce.

293
00:20:45,185 --> 00:20:46,465
This is Shang Zhitao.

294
00:20:47,785 --> 00:20:48,985
I don't have to introduce myself.

295
00:20:49,065 --> 00:20:50,505
I've already met her.

296
00:20:51,025 --> 00:20:53,425
This is our first meeting.
I am Song Qiuhan.

297
00:20:53,505 --> 00:20:56,265
We are Luke's best friends from school.

298
00:20:56,345 --> 00:20:58,785
Listen. I've known him for many years,

299
00:20:58,865 --> 00:21:01,785
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

300
00:21:05,345 --> 00:21:07,025
Come, Ms. Shang.

301
00:21:09,025 --> 00:21:10,865
What an honor.

302
00:21:11,465 --> 00:21:12,385
I finally met you.

303
00:21:12,985 --> 00:21:14,825
-Now that I've met you…
-Are you out of your mind?

304
00:21:14,905 --> 00:21:17,345
Now that I've met you, I see you
not only raise a good dog,

305
00:21:18,065 --> 00:21:19,945
but also do a good job managing Luke.

306
00:21:20,025 --> 00:21:22,665
Are you sick? What are you trying to say?

307
00:21:22,745 --> 00:21:24,145
I'm saying you are obedient.

308
00:21:25,225 --> 00:21:27,905
When it comes to obedience,
no one can outdo a simp like you.

309
00:21:29,665 --> 00:21:30,745
We're the same.

310
00:21:34,985 --> 00:21:38,585
Luke, what made you decide
to open a bar here?

311
00:21:38,665 --> 00:21:40,985
Even if it doesn't make any money,
won't you want to recoup your cost?

312
00:21:41,585 --> 00:21:43,185
Exactly. It's a remote place.

313
00:21:43,265 --> 00:21:45,025
How is it going to be successful?

314
00:21:46,585 --> 00:21:48,065
Speaking of business,

315
00:21:50,065 --> 00:21:52,865
all of you have a share in this bar.

316
00:21:53,585 --> 00:21:54,425
A surprise?

317
00:21:56,505 --> 00:21:58,465
Share Purchase Agreement.

318
00:21:58,545 --> 00:22:00,185
What is the meaning of this?

319
00:22:00,265 --> 00:22:02,625
Does this mean we will be jointly liable
if this business fails?

320
00:22:03,785 --> 00:22:05,265
This bar is not open to the public,

321
00:22:05,785 --> 00:22:06,825
but it's fully booked this week.

322
00:22:07,505 --> 00:22:10,145
The Anns from Fumei Group
and Ruixing Group

323
00:22:10,225 --> 00:22:11,985
will be here for an event
in the next two days.

324
00:22:12,065 --> 00:22:15,065
Next week, the newly appointed
Mr. Guan of Yuanjing will be here.

325
00:22:16,305 --> 00:22:18,025
It's not open to the public,

326
00:22:19,385 --> 00:22:23,025
meaning it's like a private club.

327
00:22:24,945 --> 00:22:26,785
-See?
-It seems like we are too shortsighted.

328
00:22:26,865 --> 00:22:30,625
When it comes to running a bar,
you are much better than Song.

329
00:22:30,705 --> 00:22:32,545
I didn't know
you had such business acumen.

330
00:22:32,625 --> 00:22:34,585
Otherwise, I really should have asked you
to run my bar back then.

331
00:22:35,625 --> 00:22:36,865
Why should I work for you?

332
00:22:36,945 --> 00:22:38,465
Right. You'll be the boss.

333
00:22:39,505 --> 00:22:41,345
-I wouldn't have lost so much money.
-Exactly.

334
00:22:41,425 --> 00:22:43,265
-Come.
-Drink up.

335
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:44,225
Come.

336
00:23:11,265 --> 00:23:12,425
Allow me to introduce.

337
00:23:12,505 --> 00:23:14,345
This is Shang Zhitao.

338
00:23:14,425 --> 00:23:15,425
I've known him for many years,

339
00:23:15,505 --> 00:23:18,625
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

340
00:23:55,145 --> 00:24:01,105
THANK YOU FOR YOUR HOSPITALITY
SORRY FOR THE TROUBLE!

341
00:24:05,785 --> 00:24:08,985
HARBIN

342
00:24:09,065 --> 00:24:10,025
LAOLIANGKOU RESTAURANT

343
00:24:10,105 --> 00:24:11,145
Here it is.

344
00:24:11,745 --> 00:24:13,865
Luke, I'll take you to visit relatives
on Chinese New Year's Day.

345
00:24:15,305 --> 00:24:16,345
Coming.

346
00:24:16,425 --> 00:24:17,745
-Wow.
-Two more dishes.

347
00:24:17,825 --> 00:24:19,225
-Hey, my good boy.
-Come.

348
00:24:19,305 --> 00:24:20,505
Have you learned
how to bow with your paws?

349
00:24:20,585 --> 00:24:23,585
If you have, you'll get the red envelopes,

350
00:24:23,665 --> 00:24:25,145
and then, I'll buy meat for you.

351
00:24:25,905 --> 00:24:28,225
Mom, don't feed him meat.
He'll eat kibble.

352
00:24:28,305 --> 00:24:29,345
Meat is too salty.

353
00:24:29,945 --> 00:24:32,425
Luke, Grandpa will light firecrackers
with you later.

354
00:24:32,505 --> 00:24:34,625
Grandpa? Dad, you sure are eager
to be a grandpa.

355
00:24:34,705 --> 00:24:36,185
He's one of our family members.

356
00:24:37,545 --> 00:24:38,745
Come. It's all your favorite.

357
00:24:38,825 --> 00:24:40,985
-Aren't they good?
-They are perfect.

358
00:24:41,065 --> 00:24:42,345
-Dig in.
-Dig in.

359
00:24:42,425 --> 00:24:44,305
I'm heading to Suzhou
after Chinese New Year

360
00:24:44,385 --> 00:24:45,425
for more than two months
for my business trip.

361
00:24:45,505 --> 00:24:47,665
-I have to eat more now.
-Come. Dig in.

362
00:24:47,745 --> 00:24:51,025
-You've worked hard, Tao.
-Come. Look.

363
00:24:56,625 --> 00:24:57,465
Come.

364
00:24:57,545 --> 00:24:58,425
Cheers.

365
00:25:01,385 --> 00:25:02,225
Oh.

366
00:25:03,105 --> 00:25:06,105
Last night, Zang Yao came to me.

367
00:25:06,185 --> 00:25:09,105
She was drunk, and she cried a lot.

368
00:25:09,705 --> 00:25:12,865
She said she wanted to let go of you.

369
00:25:13,545 --> 00:25:15,145
Like for real this time.

370
00:25:16,905 --> 00:25:18,625
It'll only do her good.

371
00:25:18,705 --> 00:25:21,225
She said she finally realized

372
00:25:21,305 --> 00:25:23,865
that Shang Zhitao was special to you.

373
00:25:23,945 --> 00:25:25,985
She has never seen you like this before.

374
00:25:28,945 --> 00:25:30,385
I know why you did what you did,

375
00:25:30,465 --> 00:25:33,345
but we grew up with Zang Yao.

376
00:25:33,425 --> 00:25:35,545
You could have been kinder to her.

377
00:25:35,625 --> 00:25:38,545
What? Is giving her
false hopes kindness now?

378
00:25:39,265 --> 00:25:42,785
All right. Stop criticizing Luan Nian.

379
00:25:42,865 --> 00:25:45,345
Luke. Tell us honestly.

380
00:25:45,865 --> 00:25:47,745
Is this a serious relationship or not?

381
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:49,545
I've never fooled around
with my relationships.

382
00:25:50,905 --> 00:25:52,265
Right.

383
00:25:52,345 --> 00:25:54,825
How come you didn't bring
Ms. Shang home for Chinese New Year?

384
00:25:55,945 --> 00:25:59,025
-It's none of your business.
-Okay.

385
00:26:06,505 --> 00:26:07,945
Happy Chinese New Year.

386
00:26:08,025 --> 00:26:09,625
I wish you well.

387
00:26:10,265 --> 00:26:12,905
Happy Chinese New Year.
May your Luke grow bigger.

388
00:26:13,585 --> 00:26:15,105
Happy Chinese New Year. Cheers.

389
00:26:15,185 --> 00:26:16,585
-Come. Happy Chinese New Year.
-Happy Chinese New Year.

390
00:26:16,665 --> 00:26:18,705
Happy Chinese New Year.

391
00:26:29,065 --> 00:26:31,145
ONE MONTH LATER, SUZHOU

392
00:26:53,305 --> 00:26:54,545
-Just put it here.
-Sure.

393
00:26:54,625 --> 00:26:55,785
Thank you so much.

394
00:26:55,865 --> 00:26:57,185
You and Yuanzhu went on a business trip.

395
00:26:57,265 --> 00:26:58,785
I'll take care of our home. Don't worry.

396
00:26:58,865 --> 00:27:00,105
I'm taking good care of Luke as well.

397
00:27:00,185 --> 00:27:01,785
I knew I could count on you.

398
00:27:01,865 --> 00:27:03,105
Luan Nian will be here soon.

399
00:27:03,185 --> 00:27:05,145
-I'm waiting for him here.
-Okay.

400
00:27:05,225 --> 00:27:06,185
-I will be home soon.
-Flora.

401
00:27:06,905 --> 00:27:08,185
Mr. Wang.

402
00:27:08,265 --> 00:27:09,945
You have worked hard in the past month.

403
00:27:10,025 --> 00:27:11,625
I heard Luke would be here.

404
00:27:11,705 --> 00:27:13,265
-Yes. He…
-Flora.

405
00:27:30,865 --> 00:27:32,585
Morning, Luke.

406
00:27:34,265 --> 00:27:36,065
This is Mr. Wang
from the event management company.

407
00:27:36,145 --> 00:27:37,505
This is our boss, Luke.

408
00:27:38,665 --> 00:27:39,665
You must have had a long journey.

409
00:27:40,545 --> 00:27:42,465
I'll book a private room
to treat you and Flora

410
00:27:42,545 --> 00:27:44,865
-to a meal.
-Sure.

411
00:27:44,945 --> 00:27:46,665
But we can have the meal anytime.

412
00:27:46,745 --> 00:27:48,705
We have a conference soon.

413
00:27:51,305 --> 00:27:52,385
How is the progress?

414
00:27:52,905 --> 00:27:53,865
The setup is almost done.

415
00:27:53,945 --> 00:27:56,345
The guest reception
has been duly arranged.

416
00:27:56,425 --> 00:27:58,905
The rehearsal will begin at 3 p.m.

417
00:28:00,105 --> 00:28:02,065
Go to the venue
and double-check the schedule.

418
00:28:02,145 --> 00:28:04,025
Then, bring your team with you
for a meeting.

419
00:28:05,465 --> 00:28:06,785
I shall wait for you two at the venue.

420
00:28:06,865 --> 00:28:08,585
Let me know if you need me.

421
00:28:29,105 --> 00:28:30,905
I think your creative proposal

422
00:28:30,985 --> 00:28:32,825
does not align
with the client's strategic direction.

423
00:28:32,905 --> 00:28:34,345
What do the people think on your end?

424
00:28:34,985 --> 00:28:35,945
Well, Mr. Luan.

425
00:28:36,585 --> 00:28:39,905
Let me bring you up to speed
regarding our comments.

426
00:28:40,505 --> 00:28:43,465
We are now pushing
for a collaboration with the brand.

427
00:28:43,545 --> 00:28:46,745
We hope to leverage their resources
to increase our visibility.

428
00:28:46,825 --> 00:28:49,265
It's cheap and boosts our visibility.

429
00:28:49,345 --> 00:28:51,505
The client wants us
to expand the target audience

430
00:28:52,105 --> 00:28:53,505
to the younger generation.

431
00:28:53,585 --> 00:28:54,865
-So the idea
-Bring me a bottle of water.

432
00:28:54,945 --> 00:28:56,265
has to be surprising.

433
00:28:56,345 --> 00:29:00,585
Given the current media trend,
we can use videos,

434
00:29:00,665 --> 00:29:04,225
product placements,
or targeted placement in vertical markets.

435
00:29:04,305 --> 00:29:05,665
It's sort of like digital menus.

436
00:29:06,505 --> 00:29:08,665
But we also have a more traditional idea,

437
00:29:08,745 --> 00:29:10,945
which is more aligned
with the brand's direction.

438
00:29:11,025 --> 00:29:11,945
Carry on.

439
00:29:12,025 --> 00:29:13,105
Working with online content,

440
00:29:13,185 --> 00:29:15,945
we have selected five major influencers
on Weibo whose tone matches our brand

441
00:29:16,025 --> 00:29:17,545
and bloggers in vertical fields.

442
00:29:17,625 --> 00:29:21,745
They cover fashion, lifestyle,
tech, and digital products.

443
00:29:21,825 --> 00:29:24,505
As for the frequency,
we allocate three days to build hype,

444
00:29:24,585 --> 00:29:26,625
two days for peak days,
and one week for the long tail period.

445
00:29:27,305 --> 00:29:32,665
We will send you the influencer
fan profiles and audience overlap data

446
00:29:32,745 --> 00:29:34,065
with our target brand audience by tonight.

447
00:29:34,705 --> 00:29:38,065
As for physical events, we have come up
with three interactive segments.

448
00:29:38,145 --> 00:29:39,985
The first one is a flash mob.

449
00:29:40,065 --> 00:29:43,825
The second is a QR code
that unlocks our brand's history.

450
00:29:43,905 --> 00:29:45,505
And the third one is the Weibo mega screen

451
00:29:45,585 --> 00:29:47,465
-Take the meeting minutes.
-that visitors can interact with.

452
00:29:47,545 --> 00:29:50,905
We estimate more
than 3,000 visitors per show.

453
00:29:50,985 --> 00:29:52,065
I see.

454
00:29:52,745 --> 00:29:54,825
I think we can swap the order
of these two proposals.

455
00:29:55,425 --> 00:29:56,265
Okay.

456
00:30:07,785 --> 00:30:09,745
It's around 7 p.m. now.
Let's take a break.

457
00:30:09,825 --> 00:30:11,745
-A 40-minute dinner break.
-Okay.

458
00:30:11,825 --> 00:30:14,145
-We'll continue after the meal.
-Hello. It's the food delivery.

459
00:30:19,345 --> 00:30:20,185
Pardon me.

460
00:30:24,665 --> 00:30:25,785
Enjoy your meal.

461
00:30:27,145 --> 00:30:28,185
Thank you.

462
00:30:29,065 --> 00:30:30,185
Let's eat.

463
00:30:44,465 --> 00:30:45,505
Did you miss me?

464
00:30:52,105 --> 00:30:53,945
You've been on this business trip
for a long time.

465
00:30:55,145 --> 00:30:56,145
Have you ever missed me?

466
00:31:27,825 --> 00:31:30,545
Is everyone here? Let's begin.

467
00:31:30,625 --> 00:31:35,505
Sure, Mr. Luan. So, we chose
a venue next to Taihu Lake this time.

468
00:31:35,585 --> 00:31:38,385
It fits perfectly with this year's
Traditional Chinese-style initiative,

469
00:31:38,465 --> 00:31:41,145
the localization of international brands,

470
00:31:41,225 --> 00:31:44,585
and the brand's re-invigoration
of traditional culture.

471
00:31:44,665 --> 00:31:47,225
They are trending topics at the moment.

472
00:31:47,745 --> 00:31:51,785
And the latest strategy in Lime China
is to study the local culture

473
00:31:51,865 --> 00:31:53,265
to bring out the Chinese spirit.

474
00:31:53,345 --> 00:31:54,385
Tell me more about the itinerary.

475
00:31:54,465 --> 00:31:56,505
Please confirm
the subsequent marketing plans

476
00:31:56,585 --> 00:31:59,065
-with me today as well.
-I will send the itinerary to you soon.

477
00:31:59,145 --> 00:32:00,145
As for the marketing plans,

478
00:32:00,225 --> 00:32:01,385
we will conduct a survey
with the Creative Division

479
00:32:01,465 --> 00:32:02,465
before finalizing them.

480
00:32:02,545 --> 00:32:05,785
All right. Good work.
That's all for today's meeting.

481
00:32:05,865 --> 00:32:06,905
Sure.

482
00:32:17,065 --> 00:32:18,305
Hello?

483
00:32:18,385 --> 00:32:20,505
The headquarters are planning
to bring in a general manager.

484
00:32:20,585 --> 00:32:21,585
Are you aware of it?

485
00:32:26,225 --> 00:32:27,145
We'll speak later.

486
00:32:33,105 --> 00:32:33,945
I have to go now.

487
00:32:36,025 --> 00:32:36,865
You won't stay here?

488
00:32:39,105 --> 00:32:40,185
No.

489
00:32:40,265 --> 00:32:44,585
I need to check on the progress
and write the work report.

490
00:32:47,865 --> 00:32:50,465
Do you know how to write one?
Do you need my help?

491
00:32:52,265 --> 00:32:53,185
No need.

492
00:32:53,705 --> 00:32:55,985
I don't need your help
to get my promotion.

493
00:32:56,585 --> 00:32:58,425
Thank you for the offer, Mr. Luan.

494
00:32:59,105 --> 00:33:00,865
I'll send you some insider websites later.

495
00:33:00,945 --> 00:33:02,545
Other than working hard,

496
00:33:02,625 --> 00:33:04,745
knowing how to demonstrate
your growth and achievement

497
00:33:04,825 --> 00:33:07,105
is very important at work as well.

498
00:33:15,505 --> 00:33:16,985
Are you actually helping me?

499
00:33:19,585 --> 00:33:20,465
Shang Zhitao.

500
00:33:22,625 --> 00:33:23,945
I hope you'll get the promotion

501
00:33:24,945 --> 00:33:26,665
because you have achieved many things

502
00:33:27,665 --> 00:33:28,705
and have a great working attitude.

503
00:33:30,385 --> 00:33:33,265
Your brain is also better than before.

504
00:33:37,625 --> 00:33:39,105
Is that a compliment?

505
00:33:40,625 --> 00:33:42,585
Didn't you tell me
to compliment you occasionally?

506
00:34:07,825 --> 00:34:08,744
Tao.

507
00:34:09,385 --> 00:34:10,585
You're finally back.

508
00:34:11,105 --> 00:34:13,385
Your business trip was so long.
How was it?

509
00:34:13,465 --> 00:34:14,545
It was okay.

510
00:34:16,585 --> 00:34:17,425
What?

511
00:34:20,945 --> 00:34:22,865
We have a new general manager now.

512
00:34:22,945 --> 00:34:24,385
He's on the same level as Luke.

513
00:34:26,585 --> 00:34:28,784
-What do you mean?
-His name is Dony.

514
00:34:28,865 --> 00:34:31,065
A pretentious elite who returned to China.

515
00:34:31,145 --> 00:34:33,625
Apparently, the board sent him here.

516
00:34:33,705 --> 00:34:34,705
I did my research.

517
00:34:34,784 --> 00:34:36,824
His resume is as impressive as Luke's.

518
00:34:36,905 --> 00:34:38,705
There's a rumor recently saying

519
00:34:38,784 --> 00:34:40,225
that Luan Nian will become
the general manager.

520
00:34:40,304 --> 00:34:41,585
Then, he suddenly appears.

521
00:34:42,425 --> 00:34:43,585
It's fishy.

522
00:34:45,225 --> 00:34:46,784
They don't want Luke
to become too powerful.

523
00:34:46,865 --> 00:34:48,185
They want to keep him in check.

524
00:34:49,065 --> 00:34:51,105
It's not a good thing, I'm sure.

525
00:34:56,185 --> 00:34:59,265
What is your opinion regarding
the investment ratio of the new media?

526
00:34:59,945 --> 00:35:03,385
I think we can study the recent--

527
00:35:05,505 --> 00:35:06,985
Sorry for the interruption.

528
00:35:07,745 --> 00:35:09,145
Allow me to introduce.

529
00:35:09,225 --> 00:35:11,545
This is the new general manager
of the Business Division,

530
00:35:11,625 --> 00:35:14,305
Dony. He will be in charge
of the new media marketing strategy.

531
00:35:15,225 --> 00:35:16,305
Welcome on board.

532
00:35:19,385 --> 00:35:21,345
The headquarters wants him
to join today's meeting.

533
00:35:21,945 --> 00:35:23,545
I'll let you guys work.

534
00:35:27,585 --> 00:35:29,745
Luke. I've heard about you.

535
00:35:30,505 --> 00:35:31,625
I look forward to working with you.

536
00:35:32,145 --> 00:35:33,305
Likewise.

537
00:35:34,465 --> 00:35:36,585
We were talking about next year's
new media marketing proposal.

538
00:35:36,665 --> 00:35:37,745
Join us.

539
00:35:38,265 --> 00:35:40,905
I've read the proposal before I came here.

540
00:35:40,985 --> 00:35:44,825
I think it can use some new ideas.

541
00:35:45,745 --> 00:35:47,785
We are now in the digital era.

542
00:35:48,625 --> 00:35:50,025
Independent media outlets
have become influential.

543
00:35:50,105 --> 00:35:55,145
The interaction between users
and media shouldn't remain unchanged.

544
00:35:55,745 --> 00:36:00,345
We must inject new life into the image
for better user interaction

545
00:36:00,425 --> 00:36:02,825
and retention rate. Don't you agree?

546
00:36:07,905 --> 00:36:08,745
Right.

547
00:36:09,345 --> 00:36:11,145
You want an A/B test.

548
00:36:11,225 --> 00:36:14,025
We at Lime support new strategies
and different perspectives.

549
00:36:14,705 --> 00:36:15,545
I look forward to reading your proposal.

550
00:36:16,745 --> 00:36:17,745
Thank you, Luke.

551
00:36:18,265 --> 00:36:19,785
Let's go over this again.

552
00:36:20,545 --> 00:36:21,585
Sure. Carry on without me.

553
00:36:22,265 --> 00:36:23,945
I have a meeting later, don't I?

554
00:36:25,745 --> 00:36:29,225
And welcome. Familiarize yourself
with our work.

555
00:36:29,305 --> 00:36:32,265
If you have time,
you can take a walk outside too.

556
00:36:32,345 --> 00:36:33,545
Beijing has changed a lot.

557
00:36:46,185 --> 00:36:47,585
You must be Flora.

558
00:36:49,225 --> 00:36:50,465
Dony.

559
00:36:50,545 --> 00:36:54,665
I was told you handled the cases
regarding new media marketing.

560
00:36:56,945 --> 00:37:01,505
I need to relaunch several projects.
Can you help me?

561
00:37:03,105 --> 00:37:06,145
Sure. Let me know if you need me.

562
00:37:06,225 --> 00:37:07,625
I definitely need your assistance.

563
00:37:08,625 --> 00:37:11,225
I'll ask my division to send you
the meeting notification as well.

564
00:37:11,825 --> 00:37:15,185
Do it well. I have plenty of opportunities
for you to shine.

565
00:37:16,305 --> 00:37:18,945
-Okay.
-Go back to your work.

566
00:37:25,505 --> 00:37:26,705
Dony?

567
00:37:29,465 --> 00:37:30,585
Why him of all people?

568
00:37:31,425 --> 00:37:32,785
And parachuted into the office as well?

569
00:37:36,305 --> 00:37:38,265
He's up to no good.

570
00:37:38,345 --> 00:37:40,185
What rotten luck.

571
00:37:41,825 --> 00:37:43,585
Luan Nian has a history with him.

572
00:37:45,665 --> 00:37:47,465
I told you that a guy
betrayed Luan Nian back then.

573
00:37:48,345 --> 00:37:49,705
He was that guy.

574
00:37:52,345 --> 00:37:53,985
They are our rivals.

575
00:37:54,585 --> 00:37:55,745
What did they offer you?

576
00:37:56,345 --> 00:37:59,145
You took my core idea as your ticket in.

577
00:37:59,225 --> 00:38:01,305
I spent three months working on it.

578
00:38:06,745 --> 00:38:07,745
What is the meaning of this?

579
00:38:08,585 --> 00:38:10,825
You can't say it was your effort alone.

580
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:13,345
I was the one who dealt with the client.

581
00:38:13,945 --> 00:38:15,865
If you don't want to work with me,
you may leave.

582
00:38:16,385 --> 00:38:17,425
The company can be closed down.

583
00:38:17,505 --> 00:38:20,145
But you took my core idea
and sold it to our rivals

584
00:38:20,225 --> 00:38:23,025
to use it against me. Now that's betrayal.

585
00:38:23,625 --> 00:38:24,865
Do you have no shame?

586
00:38:25,945 --> 00:38:27,145
We were brothers.

587
00:38:27,705 --> 00:38:29,185
I do not think I did you wrong.

588
00:38:29,265 --> 00:38:32,505
You know very well this company
has burned through all its cash.

589
00:38:33,105 --> 00:38:35,465
Yes, you are rich,

590
00:38:35,545 --> 00:38:36,705
but I'm not.

591
00:38:37,305 --> 00:38:38,385
I cannot run on an empty stomach

592
00:38:38,465 --> 00:38:41,145
to waste time with you
on your so-called pursuit of perfection.

593
00:38:41,665 --> 00:38:43,865
The priority for this company
is to survive.

594
00:38:43,945 --> 00:38:45,545
You're committing a crime.

595
00:38:46,505 --> 00:38:47,545
I'm seeking legal action.

596
00:38:58,785 --> 00:39:02,145
I really hate that you always
put on that artist act.

597
00:39:02,785 --> 00:39:04,105
You think you're the only genius?

598
00:39:04,185 --> 00:39:08,665
Without me, your unrealistic idea
has no value.

599
00:39:08,745 --> 00:39:10,545
It's just a pipe dream. Do you get it?

600
00:39:12,265 --> 00:39:13,545
Whether it's a pipe dream or not

601
00:39:14,145 --> 00:39:16,265
does not mean
I can't kick you out of this place.

602
00:39:25,625 --> 00:39:26,945
‎WHISPERING PEAKS CREATIVE STUDIO

603
00:39:37,585 --> 00:39:39,425
I didn't want to tell you all this,

604
00:39:39,945 --> 00:39:43,585
but I know you are special to Luke.

605
00:39:45,105 --> 00:39:47,745
As you already know, he is a prideful man.

606
00:39:48,265 --> 00:39:51,305
Even though you now know the story,
do not bring it up in front of him.

607
00:40:15,945 --> 00:40:17,385
Can you mix a drink for me?

608
00:40:37,825 --> 00:40:38,985
A special drink.

609
00:40:41,625 --> 00:40:42,625
What is it called?

610
00:40:43,625 --> 00:40:44,785
It has no name.

611
00:40:44,865 --> 00:40:46,225
No name?

612
00:40:47,345 --> 00:40:48,425
I'll name it then.

613
00:40:50,025 --> 00:40:51,465
Let's call it

614
00:40:52,225 --> 00:40:53,345
One Heart.

615
00:40:58,665 --> 00:40:59,945
What are you getting at?

616
00:41:01,545 --> 00:41:05,305
Lumi told me that Dony
had a complicated background.

617
00:41:06,025 --> 00:41:09,025
Not only did he ask me
to join his new project,

618
00:41:09,625 --> 00:41:12,185
but he also asked several other
key employees to join him.

619
00:41:13,985 --> 00:41:16,465
That's work for you.
Things are not simple.

620
00:41:17,665 --> 00:41:20,105
If someone asks you to pick a side,
will you do it?

621
00:41:20,945 --> 00:41:23,505
Pick his side,
and I might become your enemy.

622
00:41:23,585 --> 00:41:26,025
If you don't, you might be eliminated.

623
00:41:28,945 --> 00:41:30,425
I will never betray you.

624
00:41:36,225 --> 00:41:37,585
And I will never
put my guard up against you.

625
00:41:46,225 --> 00:41:49,065
Oh. I have a business trip in two days.

626
00:41:49,145 --> 00:41:51,545
Can you look after Luke for me?

627
00:41:52,865 --> 00:41:55,305
No. Because I might cook him.

628
00:41:57,185 --> 00:41:58,465
Sure.

629
00:41:59,025 --> 00:42:00,625
Why don't you cook me first?

630
00:42:00,705 --> 00:42:02,225
Cook me first, then cook him next.

631
00:42:02,305 --> 00:42:04,945
You're not delicious
because you lack a brain.

632
00:42:09,385 --> 00:42:10,425
You…

633
00:42:11,545 --> 00:42:13,625
That won't work, Shang Zhitao.

634
00:42:15,265 --> 00:42:16,185
No.

635
00:42:17,145 --> 00:42:18,785
Please.

636
00:42:19,825 --> 00:42:21,705
Take care of him, please?

637
00:42:22,585 --> 00:42:24,745
If he pees in my room, I'll smack him.

638
00:42:25,585 --> 00:42:28,105
If he bites my things, I'll smack him too.

639
00:42:29,625 --> 00:42:32,585
Okay. He needs
to be responsible for his actions.

640
00:42:32,665 --> 00:42:33,905
Smack him.

641
00:42:37,705 --> 00:42:39,185
Do you like it?

642
00:42:40,745 --> 00:42:43,745
I can take three of it
without any problem.

643
00:42:43,825 --> 00:42:45,905
Aren't I amazing? Have I improved myself?

644
00:42:45,985 --> 00:42:47,425
Of everything you can improve on,

645
00:42:47,945 --> 00:42:49,065
you picked drinking?

646
00:42:49,145 --> 00:42:52,425
What if I had to drink at a social event?

647
00:42:52,505 --> 00:42:54,225
I would hold my drinks better than before.

648
00:42:54,305 --> 00:42:56,225
Drinking is never mandatory
at any social event.

649
00:42:56,745 --> 00:42:58,585
Remember what I told you?

650
00:43:00,185 --> 00:43:01,025
Yes.

651
00:43:01,665 --> 00:43:03,665
Turn down drinks if I can.

652
00:43:04,465 --> 00:43:06,425
I don't like it
when you drink with someone else.

653
00:43:09,785 --> 00:43:10,905
Can you do that for me?

654
00:43:11,785 --> 00:43:12,785
Okay.

655
00:43:14,265 --> 00:43:15,105
Pinky promise.

656
00:43:15,825 --> 00:43:17,865
Whoever tells a lie

657
00:43:17,945 --> 00:43:19,065
-will sink to the bad place.
-You're crazy.

658
00:43:26,225 --> 00:43:28,785
NORTHWESTERN CHINA

659
00:43:38,505 --> 00:43:39,985
Hello, Yuanzhu.

660
00:43:41,985 --> 00:43:44,225
I have come to your region!

661
00:44:20,225 --> 00:44:21,625
Luke!

662
00:44:42,985 --> 00:44:45,505
Hongqi has put on some weight.

663
00:44:53,465 --> 00:44:57,065
I feel the atmosphere
at the office has been weird lately.

664
00:44:57,865 --> 00:44:59,545
Everyone has been gossiping.

665
00:45:03,825 --> 00:45:05,145
Focus on your work.

666
00:45:06,145 --> 00:45:07,865
Don't worry about other things.

667
00:45:08,545 --> 00:45:09,625
Don't get yourself involved.

668
00:45:13,145 --> 00:45:14,265
Yes.

669
00:45:14,785 --> 00:45:18,345
Because I'm small and insignificant.
Who am I to worry about everything?

670
00:45:25,225 --> 00:45:26,185
You're small.

671
00:45:27,145 --> 00:45:28,065
But not insignificant.

